ctr: a tap on the black touch screen closes the menu

While the menu is open without bottom_menu.png (CTR_BOTTOM_MENU_BLANK,
patch 0005), tapping the touch screen closes it and resumes the game, the
same way a tap in game opens it.

--- a/gfx/drivers/ctr_gfx.c
+++ b/gfx/drivers/ctr_gfx.c
@@ -1226,8 +1226,12 @@
       switch (ctr->bottom_menu)
       {
          case CTR_BOTTOM_MENU_NOT_AVAILABLE:
-         case CTR_BOTTOM_MENU_BLANK:
             return;
+         case CTR_BOTTOM_MENU_BLANK:
+            /* The menu is open over a black touch screen: a tap closes it
+             * and resumes the game, as a tap in game opens it. */
+            BIT64_SET(lifecycle_state, RARCH_MENU_TOGGLE);
+            break;
          case CTR_BOTTOM_MENU_DEFAULT:
             BIT64_SET(lifecycle_state, RARCH_MENU_TOGGLE);
             break;
